__pycache__/
*.pyc

# PyInstaller build output (both the disposable intermediate directory and
# the final .exe). Confirmed this network/proxy blocks pushing executable
# content to GitHub outright (a same-sized random-data file of equal size
# pushed fine; the .exe consistently got HTTP 403 after a full, successful
# object transfer, regardless of a freshly re-authenticated token) - so the
# built .exe is handed to IT directly rather than tracked in git. Regenerate
# with:
#   python -m PyInstaller packaging/VATComplianceAutomation.spec --distpath packaging/dist --workpath packaging/build --noconfirm
packaging/build/
packaging/dist/
